coordination on long flights, and whether his reluctance to further his education could limit future adaptability to new procedures or technology.\n**What would change my vote:** Concrete evidence that C\u2019s communication issues have led to operational problems or that another candidate demonstrates comparable reliability, calmness, and decision\u2011making while also possessing strong teamwork/communication skills.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
