ucation could limit future adaptability.\n**What would change my vote:** Concrete evidence that C\u2019s communication issues have led to operational problems, or evidence that another candidate (B, A, or D) possesses comparable reliability, calmness, and decision\u2011making while also demonstrating strong teamwork/communication strengths.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
